    "按下去的當下就震（不是放開才震），選字、切換鍵盤也有。震動需要在系統設定打開「允許完整取用」（跟語音一樣），按鍵聲音不用；手機靜音或系統把觸覺回饋關掉時都不會有。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It fires the moment you press a key, not when you lift your finger — picking candidates and switching keyboards too. Haptics need \"Allow Full Access\" in Settings (same as speech); key sounds do not. Nothing happens when the phone is muted or the system has haptics off."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按下去的当下就振（不是松开才振），选字、切换键盘也有。振动需要在系统设置打开“允许完全访问”（跟语音一样），按键声音不用；手机静音或系统把触觉反馈关掉时都不会有。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按下去的當下就震（不是放開才震），選字、切換鍵盤也有。震動需要在系統設定打開「允許完整存取」（跟語音一樣），按鍵聲音不用；手機靜音或系統把觸覺回饋關掉時都不會有。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It fires the moment you press a key, not when you lift your finger — picking candidates and switching keyboards too. Haptics need \"Allow Full Access\" in Settings (same as speech); key sounds do not. Nothing happens when the phone is muted or the system has haptics off."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
