    "為什麼會跳到 App：iOS 不允許鍵盤直接使用麥克風，所有語音鍵盤（包括 Typeless、Wispr Flow）都要先打開自己的 App。從 iOS 26.4 起，Apple 也不再讓任何 App 自動跳回原 App，所以要手動回去一次；把「鍵盤語音保持開啟」調長，就能少跳很多次。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Why it switches to the app: iOS won't let a keyboard use the microphone directly, so every speech keyboard (Typeless and Wispr Flow included) has to open its own app first. Since iOS 26.4, Apple no longer lets any app switch back for you, so you go back by hand once. A longer \"Keep keyboard speech on\" window means far fewer switches."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "为什么会跳到 App：iOS 不允许键盘直接使用麦克风，所有语音键盘（包括 Typeless、Wispr Flow）都要先打开自己的 App。从 iOS 26.4 起，Apple 也不再让任何 App 自动跳回原 App，所以要手动回去一次；把“键盘语音保持开启”调长，就能少跳很多次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
