    "裝置端優先。不支援時會改用 Apple 伺服器辨識（音訊會離開裝置），聽寫畫面上會標示是哪一種。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On-device first. When it isn't supported, Apple servers take over (audio leaves the device) — the dictation screen tells you which one is running."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设备端优先。不支持时会改用 Apple 服务器识别（音频会离开设备），听写界面上会标示是哪一种。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
