        }
      }
    },
    "設定 → 字典（選「新增詞彙」）。人名、品牌、術語（Atmos、Pro Tools…）加進去：英文專名貼上前會照字典改正拼法，高準確度辨識、雲端辨識和智慧整理也會參考這些詞。手機內建辨識本身不一定認得。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Settings → Dictionary (tap \"Add terms\"). Put names, brands and terms in there (Atmos, Pro Tools…): English proper nouns get their spelling corrected from the dictionary before insertion, and high-accuracy recognition, cloud recognition and Smart Cleanup all draw on it. The phone's own recogniser may not know them at all."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置 → 词典（选“新增词汇”）。人名、品牌、术语（Atmos、Pro Tools…）加进去：英文专名粘贴前会按词典改正拼写，高准确度识别、云端识别和智能整理也会参考这些词。手机内置识别本身不一定认得。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "設定 → 智慧整理，存好 Groq（推薦）、Gemini 或阿里雲百鍊的 key 後，打開「雲端辨識」。鍵盤和 App 講完的錄音會用你的 key 上傳辨識，專有名詞更準；失敗會自動改用手機辨識。錄音會離開手機，在意的話不要開。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Save a Groq (recommended), Gemini or Alibaba Cloud Bailian key under Settings → Smart Cleanup, then turn on \"Cloud recognition\". Recordings from the keyboard and the app are re-recognised with your key, which gets proper nouns right more often; if it fails, it falls back to on-device recognition automatically. Audio leaves your phone, so leave this off if that matters to you."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置 → 智能整理，保存好 Groq（推荐）、Gemini 或阿里云百炼的 key 后，打开“云端识别”。键盘和 App 说完的录音会用你的 key 上传识别，专有名词更准；失败会自动改用手机识别。录音会离开手机，介意的话不要开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "設定 → 高準確度辨識，下載模型後，在 UTUVO Type App 裡聽寫會更準。鍵盤聽寫時 App 在背景，iOS 不允許背景使用 GPU，所以鍵盤不會用這個模型；鍵盤想更準請用下面的「雲端辨識」。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Settings → High-accuracy recognition. Once the model is downloaded, dictation inside the UTUVO Type app is more accurate. When the keyboard dictates, the app is in the background and iOS forbids background GPU work, so the keyboard doesn't use this model — for a more accurate keyboard, use \"Cloud recognition\" below."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置 → 高准确度识别，下载模型后，在 UTUVO Type App 里听写会更准。键盘听写时 App 在后台，iOS 不允许后台使用 GPU，所以键盘不会用这个模型；键盘想更准请用下面的“云端识别”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
