      }
    },
    "講完先貼出手機整理的結果，大模型約一秒後把改口、贅詞、錯字整理好再替換。聲音不會離開手機，只有辨識好的文字會送到你選的服務。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The on-device result is pasted first; about a second later the model tidies up false starts, filler and mistakes, then swaps it in. Your voice never leaves the phone — only the recognised text goes to the service you picked."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "说完先贴出手机整理的结果，大模型约一秒后把改口、赘词、错字整理好再替换。声音不会离开手机，只有识别好的文字会发送到你选的服务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "講完先貼出辨識結果，再自動刪掉贅詞、改口、補標點。有 Apple Intelligence 的 iPhone 不用設定；也可以在「智慧整理」填自己的 key 用雲端模型。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The recognised text is pasted first, then filler, false starts and missing punctuation are cleaned up automatically. An iPhone with Apple Intelligence needs no setup; you can also add your own key under \"Smart Cleanup\" and use a cloud model."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "说完先贴出识别结果，再自动删掉赘词、改口、补标点。有 Apple Intelligence 的 iPhone 不用设置；也可以在“智能整理”填自己的 key 使用云端模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "講完先貼出辨識結果，大模型在背景整理改口、贅詞和錯字，再安全替換。沒有設定 key 時，用 Apple Intelligence 在這支手機上整理，文字不離機；設定 key 後改用下面選的雲端服務。是否使用 Apple 雲端辨識，請在「辨識與隱私」設定管理；雲端整理服務只會收到辨識文字與你選擇傳送的欄位脈絡。開了下面的「雲端辨識」時，錄音也會送到同一家服務。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The recognised text is pasted first, then a model tidies up false starts, filler and mistakes in the background and swaps the result in safely. With no key set, Apple Intelligence does the cleanup on this phone and your text never leaves it; once you add a key, the cloud service you pick below is used. Manage whether Apple cloud recognition is used under \"Recognition & Privacy\"; the cloud cleanup service receives only the recognised text and whichever field context you chose to send. With \"Cloud recognition\" on below, the audio goes to that same service as well."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "说完先贴出识别结果，大模型在后台整理改口、赘词和错字，再安全替换。没有设置 key 时，用 Apple Intelligence 在这台手机上整理，文字不离开设备；设置 key 后改用下面选的云端服务。是否使用 Apple 云端识别，请在“识别与隐私”设置中管理；云端整理服务只会收到识别文字与你选择发送的输入框上下文。开启下面的“云端识别”时，录音也会发送到同一家服务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "講完再點一次光球（或停下來），文字就會出現在游標處。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap the orb once more when you're done (or just stop talking), and the text appears at the cursor."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "说完再点一次光球（或停下来），文字就会出现在光标处。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
