    "選「不保留」之後就不再寫入歷史紀錄，但使用數據照算。保留期限只管歷史（星號也會跟著被刪），首頁的字數與時長來自另外計的每日數字，刪歷史不會少。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Choosing \"Keep nothing\" stops new history entries being written, but usage data is still counted. Retention applies to history only (starred entries go with it); the word counts and durations on the home screen come from separately tracked daily totals, and deleting history doesn't lower them."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选「不保留」之后就不再写入历史记录，但使用数据照算。保留期限只管历史（星号也会跟着被删），首页的字数与时长来自另外计的每日数字，删历史不会少。"
