    "鍵盤第一次講話會跳到 UTUVO Type 開麥克風，之後在這段時間內都不用再跳。時間越長越少跳；期間麥克風保持開啟（狀態列有橘點），但只有你點光球時才會處理聲音。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The first time you talk, the keyboard switches to UTUVO Type to open the microphone; after that you won't switch again for the length of this window. The longer it is, the fewer switches. The microphone stays open during it (an orange dot shows in the status bar), but audio is only processed when you tap the orb."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "键盘第一次讲话会跳到 UTUVO Type 开麦克风，之后在这段时间内都不用再跳。时间越长越少跳；期间麦克风保持打开（状态栏有橙点），但只有你点光球时才会处理声音。"
