        }
      }
    },
    "長按鍵盤的光球，這些語言會排在光球上方；滑到語言放開、講中文，就貼上翻譯。最多 %lld 個，至少 1 個。弧的最後一格是「＋語言」，滑過去放開可以直接在鍵盤裡加新的語言，不用回到這裡。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "長按鍵盤的光球，這些語言會排在光球上方；滑到語言放開、講中文，就貼上翻譯。最多 %lld 个，至少 1 个。弧的最后一格是「＋语言」，滑过去松开可以直接在键盘里加新的语言，不用回到这里。"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Long-press the keyboard orb to line these languages up above it; slide to a language, release, and speak Chinese to paste the translation. Up to %lld, at least 1. The last slot on the arc is \"+ Language\": slide to it and release to add a language right in the keyboard."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "開啟" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Turn on"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开启"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開啟"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "開啟後允許 Apple Speech 使用雲端辨識，音訊可能送到 Apple 伺服器；辨識文字之後才會送到你選擇的智慧整理服務。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Turning this on lets Apple Speech use cloud recognition, so audio may go to Apple's servers. Only the recognised text is sent to the Smart Cleanup service you picked."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开后允许 Apple Speech 使用云端识别，音频可能送到 Apple 服务器；识别文字之后才会发送到你选择的智能整理服务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "開啟後，會把目前欄位游標前最多 500 個字和辨識文字一起送到所選整理服務，只用來理解指涉與語氣。iOS 鍵盤無法讀取宿主 App 名稱，因此不會傳送 App 名稱。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When on, up to 500 characters from before the cursor in the current field are sent along with the recognised text to the cleanup service you picked, purely so it understands what you mean. An iOS keyboard can't read the host app's name, so no app name is sent."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开启后，会把当前输入框光标前最多 500 个字和识别文字一起发送到所选整理服务，只用来理解指代与语气。iOS 键盘无法读取宿主 App 名称，因此不会发送 App 名称。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "開啟後，講完的整段錄音會用你的 key 上傳到上面選的服務重新辨識，專有名詞通常比手機內建辨識準，大約多等 1–3 秒。上傳失敗、逾時或額度用完時，自動改用手機辨識的結果。App 內聽寫若已下載「高準確度辨識」模型，會優先用手機上的模型（不上傳）。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When on, the whole recording is re-recognised on the service you picked above using your key. Proper nouns usually come out right more often than with the phone's built-in recogniser, at the cost of 1–3 extra seconds. If the upload fails, times out or the quota runs out, it falls back to the on-device result. If the \"High-accuracy recognition\" model is already downloaded, dictation inside the app prefers the on-device model (nothing is uploaded)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开启后，说完的整段录音会用你的 key 上传到上面选的服务重新识别，专有名词通常比手机内置识别准，大约多等 1–3 秒。上传失败、超时或额度用完时，自动改用手机识别的结果。App 内听写若已下载“高准确度识别”模型，会优先用手机上的模型（不上传）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "開啟後，這個詞庫的詞會被當作辨識提示詞與智慧整理的專有名詞（依本句相關度篩入）。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When on, this pack's terms are used as recognition hints and as proper nouns for Smart Cleanup (filtered by how relevant each one is to what you said)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开启后，这个词库的词会被当作识别提示词与智能整理的专有名词（依本句相关度筛入）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開啟後，這個詞庫的詞會被當作辨識提示詞與智慧整理的專有名詞（依本句相關度篩入）。"
          }
        }
