    "依用量計費，要在 Anthropic Console 加值或有 API 額度；Claude Pro／Max 訂閱本身不能直接用，要另外申請 API key。Anthropic 預設不拿 API 送出的資料訓練模型。Claude 不能辨識語音：雲端辨識會改用你存的 Groq／Gemini key。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Billed by usage: add credit in the Anthropic Console or use your API credits. A Claude Pro/Max subscription can't be used directly; you need a separate API key. By default Anthropic doesn't train on data sent through the API. Claude can't transcribe speech: cloud recognition uses your saved Groq/Gemini key instead."
          }
